<view class="page">
  <view class="eyebrow">DEVELOPMENT SETTINGS</view>
  <view class="title">本地测试设置</view>
  <view class="subtitle">这些选项只用于验证成功和失败链路，不会调用真实模型。</view>

  <view class="mode-list">
    <view wx:for="{{modes}}" wx:key="value" class="mode {{selectedMode === item.value ? 'selected' : ''}}" data-value="{{item.value}}" bindtap="selectMode">
      <view class="mode-head">
        <view>{{item.label}}</view>
        <view class="indicator">{{selectedMode === item.value ? '●' : '○'}}</view>
      </view>
      <view class="mode-desc">{{item.description}}</view>
    </view>
  </view>

  <view class="panel data-panel">
    <view class="section-title">本地数据边界</view>
    <view class="muted">本阶段不使用微信云身份、账号、CloudBase 或真实 AI。历史保存在当前设备的小程序存储沙箱，不自动迁移到未来云端。</view>
    <button class="danger-button" bindtap="clearHistory">清空全部本地历史</button>
  </view>

  <view class="panel about-panel">
    <view class="section-title">关于这次体验</view>
    <view class="muted">阿卡纳心镜提供娱乐性自我探索，不预测确定未来，也不替代心理、医疗、法律或金融专业意见。</view>
    <view class="version">Local MVP · 0.1.0</view>
  </view>
</view>
